+ * before a plain one. Lightroom Classic's video toolkit calls CreateFromUriAsync for every video
+ * and does not check that the factory exists. Only the statics and the creation result are
+ * implemented; no AdaptiveMediaSource instance is ever created, so IAdaptiveMediaSource is
